     <actual value="5">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of bicycles: Local production and/or assembly of bicycles for the rental systems, eventually in combination with solar charging stations for future electric bikes. 
Bicycle vending and repair: Training and employment of stuff of the bicycle stations
Construction of bicycle parking systems and sharing stations: Metal construction work for bicycle racks and transformation of containers into bicycle sharing, repair and selling stations. Possibly in combination with the licensing of innovative Dutch bicycle parking solutions.
Payment system for bicycle sharing: Use of existing mobile money solutions for paying and identifying users during the rental process.
Consultancy services: diverse opportunities for (Dutch) companies to get involved in the further development of bicycle infrastructure (bike path, parking solutions, crossing and stoplight conception and design, etc.) the bicycles themselves and the design of the bicycle related public spaces.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
