      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Some of the concrete recommendations on the BRT cycle infrastructure could still directly be integrated in the construction process. Others wait for implementation in the mid-term and/or within other future projects. The communication strategy can have an import impact on the culture and perception of cycling in Dakar. Full implementation is yet still awaiting. Other key changes such as the one proposed for the integration of cycling into the traffic regulation code in of Senegal, naturally take more time and have at the moment more the status of recommendations that have to be reviewed. Nevertheless they might have an important impact in the long run on the conditions for cycling in Dakar.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
